  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The political discourse regarding a potential successor for the vice presidential position has intensified as several high-profile names are mentioned in public discussions. Representatives from the Gerindra party have noted that their internal candidates, including figures such as Sufmi Dasco, Sugiono, and Ahmad Muzani, possess a strong understanding of President Prabowo Subianto's ideological framework. Meanwhile, coalition parties have largely maintained that the selection of a nominee is the sole prerogative of the President, who is currently managing official matters abroad. Other public figures and members of the Regional Representative Council have also weighed in on the requirements for the next vice president, emphasizing the need for an individual who can represent and integrate regional interests. The ongoing speculation follows internal party considerations and public suggestions regarding how the vacancy might be filled in the coming period.",
